Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- the emoji panel (sg-emoji). explorer's Win+. and Win+;
; run ShellExecute("sg-emoji.exe", "/toggle") (wine-sg 9412), which finds the
; program here, as the Run box and scripts do (issue #15).
;
; The path is the package's install location reached through Z:. If Z: is ever
; removed from the prefix for isolation, this must move with it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\App Paths\sg-emoji.exe]
@="Z:\\usr\\libexec\\stained-glass\\shell\\sg-emoji64.exe"
